<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!-- Shadow acceptance scene (shadows v6.1, Task 5):
     hexapod_mpi.xml plus a static white obstacle box placed so that the
     hexapod's shadow falls onto the obstacle's face (non-floor receiver,
     shadow_goal.md criterion 3). Light travels toward (-1, +1, -1) in
     YARS coords; the camera looks along -x. The obstacle stands just
     behind (-x) and beside (+y) the hexapod's head, so the head casts a
     large soft shadow onto the obstacle's camera-facing (+x) face.
     Requires setShadowTextureSelfShadow(true) in OgreHandler — without
     it Ogre excludes all shadow casters from the modulative receiver
     pass and boxes never receive shadows. -->

